        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:9",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Which thing I also did in Jerusalem: and many of the saints did I shut up in prison, having received authority from the chief priests; and when they were put to death, I gave my voice against them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 59,
            "text": "Acts 9:1, 13 (13–14), 21; 22:4 (4–5)."
          },
          {
            "start": 161,
            "end": 166,
            "text": "TG Martyrdom."
          },
          {
            "start": 178,
            "end": 183,
            "text": "GR vote."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 192,
            "end": 197
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Martyrdom.",
            "prettyString": "TG Martyrdom",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
