        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:23",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And as he thus spake for himself, Festus said with a loud voice, Paul, thou art beside thyself; much learning doth make thee mad.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 125,
            "end": 128,
            "text": "JS—H 1:24 (24–25)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:24",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "But he said, I am not mad, most noble Festus; but speak forth the words of truth and soberness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:25",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "For the king knoweth of these things, before whom also I speak freely: for I am persuaded that none of these things are hidden from him; for this thing was not done in a corner.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:26",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "King Agrippa, believest thou the prophets? I know that thou believest.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "Alma 30:42 (41–42)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 26:27",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
